<main id="main">
<section class="phead"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/steam/">On Steam</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/games/questaway/">QuestAway</a></nav><h1>QuestAway</h1><p class="answer"><strong>Does QuestAway use AI?</strong> Yes. According to the developer's AI disclosure on Steam, AI was used for the art, sound effects, music and voices in QuestAway. The game is free and runs on Windows.</p><p class="note">Listed on GenPlay 24 Oct 2026 · source: Steam</p></div></section><div class="wrap game"><div><div class="cover"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99/ss_87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot" width="960" height="540" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></div><p class="m-cta"><a class="btn" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5195600/" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"/></svg>View on Steam</a></p><div class="shots"><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99/ss_87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99/ss_87d563f46fe9b4e077268f790ad221d3f4ed4f99.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 1" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/69c94c8b6f862febc1328662a5a8a7be6b0f17c5/ss_69c94c8b6f862febc1328662a5a8a7be6b0f17c5.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/69c94c8b6f862febc1328662a5a8a7be6b0f17c5/ss_69c94c8b6f862febc1328662a5a8a7be6b0f17c5.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 2" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/9b0b2f8aa3051d7f0c216531a6612b262bc85ed1/ss_9b0b2f8aa3051d7f0c216531a6612b262bc85ed1.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/9b0b2f8aa3051d7f0c216531a6612b262bc85ed1/ss_9b0b2f8aa3051d7f0c216531a6612b262bc85ed1.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 3" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/56947ca7f41f5268cd8f497c135efc2df4b4b163/ss_56947ca7f41f5268cd8f497c135efc2df4b4b163.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/56947ca7f41f5268cd8f497c135efc2df4b4b163/ss_56947ca7f41f5268cd8f497c135efc2df4b4b163.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 4" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/93310c5b91c795769d7d37b24b02ae882582153f/ss_93310c5b91c795769d7d37b24b02ae882582153f.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/93310c5b91c795769d7d37b24b02ae882582153f/ss_93310c5b91c795769d7d37b24b02ae882582153f.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 5" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a><a href="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/5e728a9fb7ef9605d6a1d61820da63265946dc4d/ss_5e728a9fb7ef9605d6a1d61820da63265946dc4d.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/5e728a9fb7ef9605d6a1d61820da63265946dc4d/ss_5e728a9fb7ef9605d6a1d61820da63265946dc4d.600x338.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway screenshot 6" width="300" height="188" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></a></div><div class="prose"><h2>Why we picked it</h2><p>QuestAway is a small idle RPG from ART X GAMES that sits next to your Windows taskbar. You build a party of heroes, send them to fight and collect loot when you come back, and twelve times a day all players take on a giant Colossus together. According to the Steam disclosure, AI tools helped make some character and enemy models, portraits, icons, sound effects, voices and the trailer music, which the team then edited. It is free, with a Mixed rating from 36 Steam reviews.</p><p class="note">GenPlay top 5, 26 Oct 2026</p><h2>In the developer's words</h2><blockquote class="quote">A tiny idle RPG that lives next to your taskbar. Build a party of heroes, send them off to fight and get back to work. There&#x27;s loot waiting when you come back. Twelve times a day, everyone takes on a giant Colossus together.<cite>From the game's page on Steam</cite></blockquote></div></div><aside class="aside"><div class="box"><h2>What AI was used for</h2><div class="meter big" role="img" aria-label="AI used for Art, Sound, Music, Voice: 4 of 6 parts, per the developer"><div class="segs"><span class="seg"></span><span class="seg on"></span><span class="seg on"></span><span class="seg on"></span><span class="seg on"></span><span class="seg"></span></div><div class="names" aria-hidden="true"><span class="">Code</span><span class="on">Art</span><span class="on">Sound</span><span class="on">Music</span><span class="on">Voice</span><span class="">Writing</span></div><div class="cap">AI used for: <b>Art, Sound, Music, Voice</b></div></div><blockquote class="quote">Some of the game&#x27;s art assets, such as character and enemy models, portraits and icons, were created during development with the assistance of generative AI tools, and were then reviewed, curated and edited by the team. The music in our trailer and some of the game&#x27;s sound effects and voices were also generated with AI tools, then edited and mixed by the team. All AI-assisted content is pre-rendered: nothing is generated while the game is running.<cite>Source: Steam AI Generated Content Disclosure</cite></blockquote></div><div class="box"><dl class="facts"><dt>Developer</dt><dd>ART X GAMES</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>Free</dd><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd><dt>Genre</dt><dd>Casual, Indie, RPG</dd><dt>Released</dt><dd>23 Oct 2026</dd><dt>Steam reviews</dt><dd>Mixed (36)</dd></dl><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5195600/" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"/></svg>View on Steam</a><button class="fav" type="button" data-fav="questaway" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save QuestAway"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 20.5 4.6 13.3a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 6.5-6.6L12 7.6l.9-.9a4.6 4.6 0 1 1 6.5 6.6Z"/></svg><span>Save</span></button></div></div><p class="note">Images and descriptions come from the developer's page. GenPlay shows what the developer disclosed about AI; we have not played every game.</p></aside></div><section class="sec" id="questions"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Questions about QuestAway</h2><h3>What did AI make in QuestAway?</h3><p>The developer lists the art, sound effects, music and voices. In their own words: “Some of the game&#x27;s art assets, such as character and enemy models, portraits and icons, were created during development with the assistance of generative AI tools, and were then reviewed, curated and edited by the team...”</p><h3>Is QuestAway free?</h3><p>QuestAway is free on Steam.</p><h3>Where can I play QuestAway?</h3><p>On <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5195600/" rel="noopener">Steam</a>. It runs on Windows.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><h2>More games like this</h2></div><div class="grid"><article class="card" data-parts="code art sound music voice text" data-browser="0" data-free="0"><div class="shot"><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5327800/0b35b12a24e4047ba8e2e81601c4fbbe5abf10e5/header.jpg?t=1792690018" alt="Last Light: Chalk Creek cover" width="480" height="300" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></div><div class="body"><h3><a href="/games/last-light-chalk-creek/">Last Light: Chalk Creek</a></h3><p class="meta"><span class="src"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M11.979 0C5.678 0 .511 4.86.022 11.037l6.432 2.658c.545-.371 1.203-.59 1.912-.59.063 0 .125.004.188.006l2.861-4.142V8.91c0-2.495 2.028-4.524 4.524-4.524 2.494 0 4.524 2.031 4.524 4.527s-2.03 4.525-4.524 4.525h-.105l-4.076 2.911c0 .052.004.105.004.159 0 1.875-1.515 3.396-3.39 3.396-1.635 0-3.016-1.173-3.331-2.727L.436 15.27C1.862 20.307 6.486 24 11.979 24c6.627 0 11.999-5.373 11.999-12S18.605 0 11.979 0zM7.54 18.21l-1.473-.61c.262.543.714.999 1.314 1.25 1.297.539 2.793-.076 3.332-1.375.263-.63.264-1.319.005-1.949s-.75-1.121-1.377-1.383c-.624-.26-1.29-.249-1.878-.03l1.523.63c.956.4 1.409 1.5 1.009 2.455-.397.957-1.497 1.41-2.454 1.012H7.54zm11.415-9.303c0-1.662-1.353-3.015-3.015-3.015-1.665 0-3.015 1.353-3.015 3.015 0 1.665 1.35 3.015 3.015 3.015 1.663 0 3.015-1.35 3.015-3.015zm-5.273-.005c0-1.252 1.013-2.266 2.265-2.266 1.249 0 2.266 1.014 2.266 2.266 0 1.251-1.017 2.265-2.266 2.265-1.253 0-2.265-1.014-2.265-2.265z"/></svg>Steam</span> · by ELIN Software · $14.99 · Windows</p><div class="meter" role="img" aria-label="AI used for Code, Art, Sound, Music, Voice, Writing: 6 of 6 parts, per the developer"><div class="segs"><span class="seg on"></span><span class="seg on"></sp